1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jean de Carmaing (c. 1400 - November 1479), baron of Saint-Felix, viscount of Caraman, lord of Negrepelisse and Montricoux, senechal of Quercy. Married (after 1427) Isabelle du Foix, lady of Navailles, daughter of 
2 CONC Archambaud de Foix-Navailles. Their descendants bear the surname "de Foix Caraman."
