1 NOTE He was Chevalier d'Aubigny, distinguished through achievements in the service of France during campaigns in Italy against Gonsalvo de Cardova. At various times he was the Viceroy of Naples, Constable of Sicily and of Jerusalem. He
2 CONC  was Duke of Terra Nova, Marquis de Girace and Squillazzo, Comte te Beaumont, d'Arcy and Venassac. He was Lord of Aubigny and Governor of Melun.
