2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. François de Mortemer (d. 1560), seigneur d’Ozillac et Roissac. See below.
2 CONT * 2. Charles de Mortemer (fl. 1560), who was the last member in the male line.
2 CONT * 3. Jeanne Catherine de Mortemer, who married first Gaillard de Lisle, seigneur of Lisle, and had issue.
