2 CONT From "The Mortimer Family of Wigmore: An outline lineage" by Ian Mortimer, Version 3.0, 16 June 2016 < [https://www.mortimer.co.uk/family/outlinelineage.pdf PDF] > Page 47
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Guy de Mortimer (d. 1512), seigneur d’Ozillac et Roissac, who married Françoise Bouchard d’Aubeterre, dame d’Ozillac, by whom he had issue.
