1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Voir [http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henriette_Catherine_de_Joyeuse '''Wikipedia...''']
2 CONT
2 CONT Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse1 F, #42308, b. 1585, d. 1656
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=6 Jan 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Henriette Catehrine de Joyeuse2     Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse was born in 1585. She married, firstly, Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier in 1597 at Rheims, Champagne, France.1,3 She married, secondly, Charles de Lorraine, D
2 CONC uc de Guise, son of Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Catherine de Nevers, in 1611. She died in 1656. Child of Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse and Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier 1.Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier
2 CONC +1 b. 15 Oct 1605, d. 4 Jun 1627 Children of Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse and Charles de Lorraine, Duc de Guise 1.François de Guise b. 1612, d. 1639 2.Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise b. 1614, d. 1664 3.Marie de Guise b. 1615, 
2 CONC d. 1688 4.Charles de Guise b. 1618, d. 1637 5.Françoise de Guise b. 1621, d. 1682 6.Louis de Lorraine, Duc de Joyeuse+ b. 1622, d. 1654 7.Roger de Guise b. 1624, d. 1653 Citations 1.[S36] Hugh Montgomery-Massingberd, editor, Burke
2 CONC 's Royal Families of the World, Volume 1: Europe & Latin America (London, U.K.: Burke's Peerage Ltd, 1977), page 84. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Royal Families of the World, Volume 1. 2.[S3409] Caroline Maubois, "re: Penancoet Fa
2 CONC mily," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 2 December 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Penancoet Family." 3.[S102] Roglo Geneweb Website, online <http://geneweb.inria.fr/roglo?lang=en>. Hereinafter cited as Roglo Geneweb Website.
