2 CONT
2 CONT Antoinette de Maillé de La Tour-Landry
2 CONT dame de Saint-Mars de La Jaille
2 CONT
2 CONT Deceased in 1585
2 CONT Dame d'honneur de la reine Catherine de Médicis
2 CONT
2 CONT  Parents
2 CONT *     Jean I de Maillé de La Tour-Landry, baron de La Tour-Landry, seigneur de Clervaux and d'Ampoigné, baron de Saint-Chartier, seigneur de Bourmont and de Châteauroux, born in 1512, deceased in 1563 aged 51 years old
2 CONT *     Anne Chabot, dame de Bouloire, de Maisoncelles and d'Escarpain, deceased in 1573 - Châteauroux, Indre, France, Dame de la reine
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouses, children, grandchildren and great-grandchildren
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 23 February 1557 (Saturday) to Claude de La Trémoille, baron de Noirmoutier, deceased in 1566 (Parents : M François de La Trémoille, vicomte de Thouars 1505-1541 &  F Anne de Laval 1505-1554) with
2 CONT *  ...       M François de La Trémoille, marquis de Noirmoutier 1566-1608  Married 18 October 1584 (Thursday) to Charlotte de Beaune, vicomtesse de Tours 1551-1617 with
2 CONT * .....            M Louis de La Trémoille, marquis de Noirmoutier 1586-1613 Married 13 March 1610 (Saturday), Paris, to Lucrèce Bouhier †1666 with :
2 CONT * .......                M Louis de La Trémoille, duc de Noirmoutier 1612-1666
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings
2 CONT *     F Anne de Maillé de La Tour-Landry Married 20 December 1543 (Monday) to Payen d'Averton, seigneur de Belin
2 CONT *     M Jean de Maillé de La Tour-Landry, seigneur de Dun-le-Palleteau †1597 Married 24 September 1587 (Thursday), Paris, to Marie Barjot †1620
2 CONT *     M René de Maillé de La Tour-Landry, seigneur d'Ampoigné Married to Andrée du Verger
2 CONT *     M François de Maillé de La Tour-Landry, baron de La Tour-Landry 1540-1598 Married 3 February 1564 (Monday), Guéméné-sur-Scorff, Morbihan, France, to Françoise de Rohan-Gié, dame de Gillebourg †1585
2 CONT *     M Louis de Maillé de La Tour-Landry, seigneur de La Fosse
2 CONT *     F Vincente de Maillé de La Tour-Landry
2 CONT *     M Raoul de Maillé de La Tour-Landry Married to Henriette d'Avaugour
