2 CONT LORD OF BEAULIEU  ALIVE IN 1620
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre, Lord of Beaulieu, Gentleman of the House of the Duke of Orleans, lived in 1620 with Anne Portas, his wife.  Second wife was Francis Pollart. 1673
2 CONT
2 CONT On Saturday, the 23rd day of March 1630, was buried noble man Léonor Deniau, housekeeper of Monseigneur de Longueville, in the parish of Sainte-Collombe-de-Servon in Brie, distant five and a half leagues from Paris, on the large c
2 CONC hemin de Brie-Comte-Robert Mourut, after having received the sacraments in the house of M. de Marillac-Beaulieu, Lord of Redmont-Villarceau, knight of the order and gentleman serving as Monsignor brother of Roy; which Marillac, af
2 CONC ter having assisted him in his illness! He also accompanied him to the tomb, which is in the church of the said parish of Sainte Collombe-de-Servon. http://radiointensite.free.fr/articles.php?lng=fr&pg=986
2 CONT
2 CONT Le samedi, 23e jour de mars 1630, fut enterré noble homme Léonor Deniau, maréchal des logis de Monseigneur de Longueville, en la paroisse de Sainte-Collombe-de-Servon en Brie, distante de cinq lieues et demie de Paris, sur le gran
2 CONC d chemin de Brie-Comte-Robert Mourut, après avoir reçu les sacrements dans la maison de M. de Marillac-Beaulieu, seigneur de Redmont-Villarceau, chevalier de l'ordre et gentilhomme servant de Monseigneur frère du Roy ; lequel Mari
2 CONC llac, après l'avoir assisté en sa maladie! L'a encore accompagné jusqu'au tombeau, qui est dans l'église do ladicte paroisse Sainte Collombe-de-Servon.
