2 CONT Portrait of Marie de Bourbon, Duchese de Montpensier by Nicolas Lagneau, 1626 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier1 F, #103553, b. 15 October 1605, d. 4 June 1627
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier|b. 15 Oct 1605\nd. 4 Jun 1627|p10356.htm#i103553|Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier||p11374.htm#i113735|Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse|b. 1585\nd. 1656|p4231.htm#i42308|||||||||||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Oct 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie de Bourbon, Duchese de Montpensier by Nicolas Lagneau, 1626 2     Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier was born on 15 October 1605 at Château de Gaillon, France.1 She was the daughter of Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpen
2 CONC sier and Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse.3,1 She married Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans, son of Henri IV, Roi de France and Marie de Medici, on 6 August 1626 at Nantes, Bretagne, France.1 She died on 4 June 1627 at age 21 at T
2 CONC he Louvre, Paris, France.1
2 CONT *  Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier gained the title of Duchesse de Montpensier.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier and Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans 1.Anne-Marie Louise d'Orléans, Duchesse de Montpensier1 b. 29 May 1627, d. 5 Apr 1693 Citations 1.[S36] Hugh Montgomery-Massingberd, editor
2 CONC , Burke's Royal Families of the World, Volume 1: Europe & Latin America (London, U.K.: Burke's Peerage Ltd, 1977), page 84. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Royal Families of the World, Volume 1.
