2 CONT * [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antoine_III_de_Gramont '''Antoine III de Gramont'''] From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Antoine de Gramont came from an old southern French noble family. His father was '''Antoine II de Gramont'
2 CONC '', his mother was Louise († 1610), daughter of Marshal Roquelaure (1543–1623). He had a younger brother, Philibert de Gramont, from their father's second marriage to Claude de Montmorency.
