1 NAME Anne Jules, II. duc de Noailles
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 FEB 1650
2 ADDR
3 CITY Paris
3 STAE Île-de-France
3 CTRY France
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 OCT 1708
2 ADDR
3 CITY Versailles
