4 CONT le septième du courant, le tout ci-dessus du concentement exprès des parties en
4 CONT présence de Messire Jean Collomb de la Vienne, major de cette ville, Messire
4 CONT Léon Baptiste Sylvestre prêtre bénéficiaire, , Messire Barhélèmy Tournu, tous
4 CONT de cette ville, témoins requis et signés avec les parties.	
4 CONT
4 CONT TRANSLATION
4 CONT  The year seventeen hundred and twenty seven, and the fifteenth of November (November 15, 1727)
4 CONT We, pastor of the town of Gap, the undersigned have made the blessing of
4 CONT marriage, during the celebration of Holy Mass and the tradition of the body,
4 CONT between noble Charles Antoine de Marillac, a lieutenant in the Regiment
4 CONT Languedoc, about thirty six years (36 years old, born in 1691), son of the late, noble
4 CONT Charles de Marillac, lord of the Belandière and Chatelier, and lady
4 CONT Marie Antoinette's Cytois, the city of Poitiers, on the one hand, and
4 CONT Lady Suzanne Renard de Saint-Julien, aged about thirty-five
4 CONT years (35 years old, born in 1692), noble daughter of the late Charles Fox
4 CONT Vagodemar, Major of this city, and Lady Justine's Suau de La Croix,
4 CONT the other city, after a proclamation of banns made by the nine of us
4 CONT this month in our parish church no canonical impediment, or civil;
4 CONT saw the exemption of a proclamation of banns it pleased my lord the Bishop
4 CONT Gap, to grant the parties shall decide insinuated and controlled the day yesterday,
4 CONT with orders he issued a proclamation that will be married on the sixteenth of the month
4 CONT ordinary forms to warn the people of the exemption.
4 CONT
4 CONT Saw three acts friendly warning, made at the request of the Demoiselle de Saint Julien, the Lady of Vagodemar, mother, to request his permission, for the purpose of this marriage, eleven, thirteen and fourteen of the current, by M
4 CONC  ° Vallon, Royal notary in that city, controller of the day yesterday by Collomb, and in accordance with the edict of Louis 13 Year 1629 on and off state of King Louis 14 of 13 December 1682 ;
4 CONT given permission in writing that the Lady de Marillac granted the Sieur de
4 CONT Marillac same effect in the second in August last certified and legalized the seventh
4 CONT this month, Considering the permission of Mr. Ferriere, Lieutenant Colonel,
4 CONT Commandand Regiment of Languedoc granted even terminate the Sieur de
4 CONT Marillac October the twenty-four certifying full freedom for
4 CONT said Sieur de Marillac, Having another certificate of freedom of the Sieur Captain
4 CONT Captain commander and other leading from the said regiment in this city
4 CONT the seventh of the current, above all the express concent of the parties
4 CONT Messire Jean Collomb presence of the Vienna headquarters of the city, Sir
4 CONT Leon Baptiste Sylvestre priest recipient, Sir Barhélèmy Tournu all
4 CONT of this city, witnesses required and signed with the parties.
4 CONT
4 CONT http://www.archives05.fr/arkotheque/etat_civil/fond_visu_img.php?ref_id=5488
