0 @N6000000002322350685@ NOTE She was opposed by Mazarin; aided Condein revolt of the Fronde (1651-52) and
1 CONT commanded troops which opposed Orleans 1652; banished from court (1652-57 &
1 CONT 1662-64); love affair with the comte de Lauzun, who as a result, was
1 CONT imprisoned in the Bastille from 1670-1680; later married him in 1681or 82;
1 CONT wrote "Memoires" published in 1729.
